<title>IRAQ: Iraq denies U.S. F-16 fired missile at Iraqi radar.</title>
<headline>Iraq denies U.S. F-16 fired missile at Iraqi radar.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraqi denied on Sunday a statement by the White House that a U.S. F-16 jet enforcing the no-fly zone in southern Iraq fired a missile at an Iraqi radar installation on Saturday.</p>
<p>&quot;Such American allegations are baseless. No incident of any kind has occurred in Iraq's air space,&quot; said the Iraqi news agency, quoting an Iraqi foreign ministry spokesman.</p>
</text>
